The '''Store''' is an in-game shop that offers various items in exchange for real-world currency or in-game premium currencies. It is accessible from the Phone menu.

==Currencies==
Items can be purchased with the following currencies:

===Real-World Currency===
* {{Item|Oneiric Shard|tsuffix=s}}
* {{Item|Express Supply Pass}}
* [[Trailblaze Assistance Pack]] (time-limited)
* [[Special Ticket Pack]] (time-limited)

===Oneiric Shards===
{{Main|Oneiric Shard}}
* [[Contract Shop|Contracts]]
* Unpurchased [[Alternate Outfit]]s
* {{Item|Stellar Jade}} can be redeemed with Oneiric Shards at a 1-to-1 ratio

===Undying Starlight===
{{Main|Undying Starlight}}
* {{Item|Star Rail Pass|tsuffix=es}}
* {{Item|Star Rail Special Pass|tsuffix=es}}
* {{Item|Tracks of Destiny}}
* Select [[Character]]s and [[Light Cone]]s

===Undying Embers===
{{Main|Undying Embers}}
* {{Item|Star Rail Pass|tsuffix=es}}
* {{Item|Star Rail Special Pass|tsuffix=es}}
* {{Item|Tracks of Destiny}}
* {{Item|Credit|tsuffix=s}}
* Select [[Character Ascension Material|Character]] and [[Light Cone Ascension Material]]s
* Select [[Character EXP Material|Character]], [[Light Cone EXP|Light Cone]], and [[Relic EXP Material]]s

===Lone Stardust===
{{Main|Lone Stardust}}
* Certain cosmetic items
* {{Item|Tears of Dreams}}

===Golden Companion Spirit===
{{Main|Golden Companion Spirit}}
* {{Item|Variable Dice}}
* Select 5-star [[Character]]s

===Light Cone Memory Shard===
{{Main|Light Cone Memory Shard}}
* Select 5-star [[Light Cone]]s

===Stellar Jade===
{{Main|Stellar Jade}}
* {{Item|Star Rail Pass|tsuffix=es}}
* {{Item|Star Rail Special Pass|tsuffix=es}}

==Shop List==
===Recommended===
This tab will display "recommended" purchases. Depending on the [[Version]], it can contain Outfits or Version-specific purchase bundles.

